<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hitachi cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hitachi cut to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Hitachi Ltd to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Hitachi gained 11/16 to 116-5/8 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
